<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian national bank allots 7.71 bln ATS repos.</title>
<headline>Austrian national bank allots 7.71 bln ATS repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allotted 7.71 billion schillings in securities repurchase agreements at a fixed rate of three percent.</p>
<p>The bank said it had met percent of the bids.</p>
<p>Last week the bank allocated 15.45 billion schillings, also at a rate of three percent, meeting 12 percent of the bids.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
